comments[45]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-15T18:53:58.181Z",codex-agent,Implementation and real-repository regression evidence linked. Review remains with the orchestrator; this item stays in progress.
  "2026-10-15T19:36:03.614Z",codex-agent,"Round 1: update docs and run unchanged npm and Bun release gates in ordinary and CI-like isolated environments; retain pinned host and disabled release policy."
  "2026-10-15T19:50:57.430Z",codex-agent,"Ordinary full release gate passed 70/70 suite tests, four 100% coverage dimensions across 18 source files, and zero production audit findings, then packed acceptance exposed untracked in-repository lane directories in its tightened fixture. Ignore the fixture-owned lane directory; retain the production clean-worktree refusal. Packed npm/native Bun acceptance also exercises default receipt omission and real full flags. Full gates will be rerun after this fixture correction."
  "2026-10-15T19:51:48.311Z",codex-agent,"Round 1 PM-linked acceptance: pm test pm-swarm-y972 --run --progress passed 1 linked command(s), 10 tests, zero failures. Full post-run snapshots unchanged: two registered worktrees, zero parallel branches, zero swarm Git configuration keys. Source, tracker and settings mutations remained inside scratch repositories."
  "2026-10-15T20:04:12.802Z",codex-agent,"Final Round 1 gates: npm run release:check and bun run release:check both pass in ordinary and CI-like environments. Each of the four runs passed 70/70 suite tests and 1/1 packed npm/npx plus native Bun/bunx acceptance, with zero fail/skip/cancel/todo. Coverage remains 100% statements/branches/functions/lines across 18 source files at unchanged thresholds; identity, types, lint, zero duplication, docstrings, production audit (zero findings), package allowlist, changelog and attestation checks pass. CI-like environment used fresh HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null, GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1, CI=true, GITHUB_ACTIONS=true and hosted source ref feat/swarm. All eight linked items passed 12 commands / 90 tests. No source changes during the four successful gate runs. Existing development-toolchain advisory remains tracked separately."
  "2026-10-15T20:12:38.180Z",codex-agent,"Round 2: confirmed inherited Git location variables remain unsanitized at 92e03fa. Use one shared environment helper for direct Git calls, fixture helpers and consumer subprocesses. Production will strip all eight location variables unconditionally so explicit repository cwd and linked-worktree discovery determine the target; preserve unrelated identity/config variables. Add decoy-repository acceptance and behavioral revert proof; retain pinned dependencies and all gate thresholds."
  "2026-10-15T20:18:07.844Z",codex-agent,"Behavioural revert proof for finding 1: removing only the shared gitEnvironment stripping loop makes the Git-location real-repository regression fail (exit 1, 0/1 pass): branchExists cannot see the intended main branch under the inherited decoy location. Restored exact helper bytes. The regression exercises branch lookup, merge prediction, driver discovery, local configuration and linked-worktree discovery, then hashes every decoy file to verify no writes. Packed acceptance additionally supplies a decoy GIT_DIR to each isolated consumer environment before sanitizing it."
  "2026-10-15T20:42:27.871Z",codex-agent,"Final Round 2 verification: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each passed in normal and CI-like environments (four runs). Each passed 73/73 suite tests plus 1/1 packed npm/npx and native Bun/bunx acceptance, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todo. Every packed acceptance supplies a decoy GIT_DIR before sanitizing consumer environments and verifies all decoy files are unchanged. CI-like runs used CI=true, GITHUB_ACTIONS=true, fresh HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1. Coverage is 100% statements/branches/functions/lines across 19 source files; unchanged thresholds, zero duplication, 40 documented declarations, clean production audit, identity, types, lint, package allowlist, changelog and attestation all pass. Recorded source/manifest/docs hashes were unchanged across the matrix. PM-linked quality acceptance passed 2 commands / 11 tests (10 + 1); changed tracker items together passed 6 commands / 36 tests. Existing development advisory remains separately tracked by pm-swarm-zn7m. No new PM CLI/SDK defect was encountered."
  "2026-10-24T21:48:47.969Z",codex-agent,"Returned to open in the 2026-10-24 sweep: Merged PR 14 is a tracker reconciliation rather than an implementing settings/quality-gate PR; the original full settings, renderer and packed-acceptance scope is not established by that audit."
  "2026-10-25T01:16:56.331Z",codex-agent,"Implement registered SDK settings with typed validation and matching flags, host output rendering and private-path refusals. Validate settings transactions on a plain tracker at each interleaving and crash boundary, packed npm/Bun consumers, and read-only public corpus measurements. Run targeted local checks and full release gates in CI."
  "2026-10-25T01:24:49.561Z",codex-agent,"SDK gap verified against the unchanged 2026.10.23 pin: ExtensionApi has no settings-section registration API and readSettings omits the swarm subtree. Implemented a typed package section definition plus public SDK raw-subtree read inside mutateWorkspaceSettings. Native host registration remains unmet, so the PR will stay draft. Four competing-transition boundaries, four exception boundaries and four real SIGKILL boundaries pass on plain trackers, preserving foreign values and replay audit bytes. Output checks include host recovery arguments."
  "2026-10-25T01:28:10.425Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proofs: eight isolated source reversions each produced exactly one regression failure (exit 1): stale pre-lock settings snapshot; removed typed validation; removed recursive private-path check; ignored replay ID; disabled host renderer; absolute CLI lane location; unredacted host error recovery; removed watch path guard. Restored each source immediately. Targeted settings/commands suite before the added watch case: 28 passed, 0 failed. SIGKILL recovery passed at all four package write boundaries with no appended audit event on replay."
  "2026-10-25T01:28:11.722Z",codex-agent,"Read-only public corpus acceptance: unbraind/pm-ops origin/main 7ad4a726d67c2d933c028db335463c36f51015fb, 151 items, 310 baseline files, 4323759 bytes, 0 changed. No Git in the copied tracker or command PATH. SDK settings and two identical planning previews plus CLI settings/plan/status and TOON/JSON rendering passed. Settings output: JSON 221 bytes, TOON 209 bytes; plan JSON 1312 bytes. Corpus had 1 active lane and 0 start candidates; no synthetic readiness claim."
  "2026-10-25T01:28:54.950Z",codex-agent,"Pinned pm test --run --progress ran the new link: 29 passed, 0 failed. The two inherited links were correctly refused as foreign branch provenance (trust_refusal=2); no approval claimed for them. Local typecheck, lint, build, docstring (31 files, 118 declarations), duplication (0 clones at 0 percent threshold), changelog generation/check passed. Full npm/Bun release checks are delegated to CI because the host is saturated."
  "2026-10-25T01:35:04.348Z",codex-agent,"CI run 40150822836 exercised 297 tests: 295 passed, 2 failed; statements/functions/lines 100 percent, branches 99.93 percent, settings module 100 in every dimension. Fixed the prerequisite test selector after splitting packed npm/Bun consumers, retained asynchronous Git generic/native expected exit codes through sanitized transport, and exercised private underlying error redaction. Targeted fixes: 6 tests passed. Three additional behavioral revert proofs each failed one test (exit 1): generic Git status retention, native SDK status retention, and private underlying-error sanitization. All fixes restored; no thresholds changed."
  "2026-10-25T01:35:27.274Z",codex-agent,"Corrected the internal lane-wrapper signature to accept the union of shared and Git record promises. Local typecheck, lint, build, docstrings and zero-duplication checks now pass after the exit-transport fixes. The typed public SDK contracts are unchanged."
  "2026-10-25T01:38:29.658Z",codex-agent,"Refined private-path matching to retain relative home-directory paths and ordinary web URLs while rejecting absolute paths, quoted paths and file URLs. Targeted privacy tests: 2 passed. Reverting only the matching function caused exactly 1 regression failure (exit 1), then the fix was restored. Total behavioral revert probes: 12, each failed its regression. Latest pinned pm linked run: 29 settings/commands plus 5 transport/prerequisite tests passed; inherited links remain 2 provenance refusals and passed directly in the separate 11-test selection. Typecheck, lint, build, docstrings and zero-duplication checks pass."
  "2026-10-25T01:40:03.570Z",codex-agent,"CI run 40151238474 passed all 299 behavioral tests on Node 22 and 26, but refused full coverage because the Git error class field initializer was not measured through the separately loaded CLI graph. Added a real in-process SDK harness test for native missing-item and generic ownership refusal statuses. It passes and measures the initializer twice. Reverting the transport function fails this new regression (1 failed, exit 1); source restored. Total behavioral revert probes: 13. No coverage exclusions or threshold changes."
  "2026-10-25T04:09:03.988Z",codex-agent,Reopened implementation after the read-only review found post-commit privacy refusal and an angle-bracket file-URL bypass. Add pure input admission before all command dispatch and SDK-backed privacy scanning with normalization for any proven SDK misses. Measure every mutating command against rejected input encodings using exact full-tracker snapshots and empty-receipt assertions. Preserve existing completed evidence; add new revert proofs and wait for full npm/Bun CI gates.
  "2026-10-25T04:33:04.649Z",codex-agent,"Review remediation: pure CLI admission now checks every content argument/flag/author before dispatch; SDK mutation entries check privacy before leases/heartbeats, and settings preflight re-reads inside its audit lock. The Cartesian test passed 3514 refused inputs over 16 mutating variants, 50 encodings and 69 text positions; separate SDK matrix passed 1050 refusals over 21 entries; 37 malformed domain cases passed. Every case fingerprints all tracker bytes, directories, links, runtime and history and captures stdout: zero changes, zero partial receipts. Native handoff regressions pass for ordinary and angle-file-URL input."
  "2026-10-25T04:33:05.460Z",codex-agent,"Privacy oracle: pinned SDK scanMutationSecrets absolute_home_path detects 10/50 raw encodings; normalization makes all 50 refuse. Exact per-encoding raw findings and Unicode transforms are documented in docs/privacy-admission.md and test/privacy-corpus.ts. Additional SDK gap: renderer exceptions become overridden:false plus extension_renderer_failed, allowing native fallback; swarm now retains ownership with a safe typed refusal, including unsafe primitive/array/unknown result shapes. All 400 encoding/format/shape cases pass."
  "2026-10-25T04:33:06.466Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proofs for the review blockers: eight isolated probes each failed exactly one regression (exit 1), then sources were restored: command admission; public SDK heartbeat admission; validate-then-write handoff (admission/handoff/transfer functions); SDK-oracle normalization; angle-file-URL native handoff; safe renderer refusal; typed malformed-input admission; private result discriminator. The post-commit handoff repro changed the tracker when pre-write checks were reverted, and the angle-file-URL repro returned success when normalization was reverted. Targeted selection: 37 tests passed; admission.ts and privacy.ts measured 100/100/100/100. Typecheck, lint, docstrings (33 files/124 declarations) and zero-duplication gates passed. Full npm/Bun release evidence remains assigned to CI."
  "2026-10-25T04:40:49.473Z",codex-agent,"Final expanded linked acceptance passed via pinned pm test --only-last --run --progress: 6 tests, 0 failures, no provenance refusals. With all 9 global string flags included, the matrix covers 9914 refused inputs across 16 mutating variants, 50 encodings and 197 text positions, plus 1050 SDK refusals, 37 malformed domain cases and 400 renderer combinations. Tracker/runtime/history snapshots remain identical and stdout contains no partial receipts. All previous work and its append-only history are preserved."
  "2026-10-25T04:51:22.747Z",codex-agent,"CI run 40162772053 passed all 307 behavioral tests but refused branches at 99.11 percent. Removed duplicate post-admission error branches; dispatch now consumes a captured, already validated scalar input frame. Added real races where a peer changes settings after preflight and the locked validator refuses without overwriting peer settings/history. Targeted selection passed 40 tests; settings.ts now has full four-dimensional coverage. Three further revert probes each failed one regression (exit 1): invalid settings reaching transaction checkpoints, removed locked revalidation, and removed caller-input snapshot. New review-remediation revert probes total 11; thresholds and exclusions unchanged."
  "2026-10-25T04:58:29.871Z",codex-agent,"Resource renew/release/publish now share pure canonical-decimal token admission across CLI and SDK before backend leases. Malformed-domain corpus expanded to 39, plus six SDK malformed-token refusals with unchanged whole-tracker snapshots. Two additional isolated revert probes each failed one test (exit 1): SDK resource token validator and CLI resource token admission. Review-remediation revert probes total 13. Final source typecheck/lint/docstrings/zero-duplication checks pass; no thresholds lowered."
  "2026-10-25T04:59:57.509Z",codex-agent,"Latest pinned linked test passed 10 tests with 0 failures: the 9914 command refusals, 1050 SDK privacy refusals, 39 malformed domains, six SDK token refusals, settings preflight/locked races and input snapshot. Resource validation also observes the real backend transaction entry counter to avoid timing-dependent heartbeat assertions. Ready for the full CI release gates on the pushed head."
  "2026-10-25T05:11:34.651Z",codex-agent,"CI run 40163921961 passed all 311 tests; the only coverage gap was the valid schedule max-wait translation branch (99.94 percent total branches). Added a real native CLI acceptance case for max-wait=17, dry-run selection and no claim. It passes, and ignoring that field in dispatch fails the regression (1 failed, exit 1), then source restored. Review-remediation revert probes total 14. Updated public non-Git corpus at 61d5b96b8a64c755ecfb6a5018dae0aad2e4aa78: 152 items, 312 read-only baseline files, 4387217 bytes, 0 changed, 2 suggested starts and 11 planned lanes; settings receipts remain 221 JSON/209 TOON bytes."
  "2026-10-25T05:18:48.508Z",codex-agent,"Strengthened the existing Windows corpus identities to use an actual UNC server authority, lowercase forward-slash Users layout and mixed-case/mixed-separator layout. Normalization now removes backslash UNC authority and case-folds home layouts without interpreting ordinary web URL authorities as local paths. Oracle and 400 rendering checks pass; raw SDK remains 10/50, package 50/50. Reverting only this normalization change fails one corpus regression (exit 1); source restored. Review-remediation revert probes total 15. Typecheck/lint/docstrings/zero-duplication checks pass."
  "2026-10-25T07:12:31.952Z",codex-agent,"Round-2 review resumes: replace home spelling normalization with canonical absolute-local-path refusal, retain SDK scanning first, add seeded compositional rejection and allowed-input generators, then record behavioral revert proof and exact-head release gates."
  "2026-10-25T07:17:28.229Z",codex-agent,"Round-2 behavioral revert proof: restored only the prior src/privacy.ts normalization module and rebuilt; node --test --test-name-pattern=\"seeded compositional|native CLI handoff\" test/privacy-admission.test.ts failed 2/2, exit 1. Native handoff incorrectly returned success for the dot-segment reproducer; compositional fuzz missed case 2 (UNC under a non-home share), seed 1369948382. Restored canonicalization and rebuilt immediately. Canonical rule now covers any POSIX, Windows drive or UNC absolute root, with SDK scanning first, bounded repeated percent/JSON/HTML decoding, confusable folding and invisible stripping. Both path grammars normalize every candidate."
  "2026-10-25T07:17:29.085Z",codex-agent,"Round-2 preliminary results: 52 fixed encodings across 197 text positions and 16 mutating variants yield 10308 byte-identical refusals including malformed scalars; SDK entry matrix covers 1092 refusals. Absolute seed 0x51a7c0de: 5000 composed cases, 80000 command refusals, 10000 renderer refusals, unchanged tracker. Allowed seed 0x6a09e667: 2500 relative paths plus 2500 HTTP(S) URLs, 80000 command admissions and 10000 successful renders, zero false privacy refusals. Original SDK raw oracle remains 10/50; two round-2 encodings are also missed by raw scanning."
  "2026-10-25T07:19:21.269Z",codex-agent,"Restored round-2 tests pass through pinned pm test: 14 passed, zero failed. Existing settings/output/command targeted suites pass 31/31. Typecheck and lint pass; duplication remains zero at the unchanged zero threshold; docstring gate documents all 127 declarations across 33 source files. Final release gates will run in CI."
  "2026-10-25T07:22:58.810Z",codex-agent,"First round-2 CI candidate exercised all 315 tests and measured canonical privacy.ts at 100 percent in all dimensions. Four older Git rollback/publication fixtures supplied absolute lane-root overrides and now correctly fail privacy admission before reaching their intended later boundary. Update only those fixture inputs to project-relative roots resolving to the same directories; retain every rollback, fence and byte/history assertion. No production guard relaxation."
  "2026-10-25T07:23:51.024Z",codex-agent,"Canonical input and settings resolution now reject all absolute roots, making three narrower post-validation isAbsolute/drive checks unreachable. Removed those redundant branches while retaining settings preflight before transaction entry and fresh locked resolveSwarmSettings validation. Existing invalid-root and peer-race regressions remain active; no coverage threshold or source exclusion changes."
  "2026-10-25T07:24:24.160Z",codex-agent,"Relative-root fixture corrections pass all four targeted Git rollback/fencing cases. Settings invalid-input and peer-race follow-up passes 4/4; typecheck, lint and zero-duplication checks pass after removing unreachable narrower checks. The canonical rule and its recorded behavioral revert proof are unchanged."
  "2026-10-25T07:28:18.332Z",codex-agent,"Final fuzz refinement supplies every generated candidate through the real global author input, shared by all mutating commands. Both seeded tests pass again: 5000 absolute candidates produce 80000 command refusals and 10000 safe renderer refusals; 2500 relative paths plus 2500 HTTP(S) URLs produce 80000 admissions and 10000 successful renders with zero false refusals. Tracker unchanged. Typecheck, lint and zero-duplication checks pass."
  "2026-10-25T07:34:27.955Z",codex-agent,"Final canonical boundary audit adds repeated labels before file URLs, brace wrappers and HTML fraction/backslash entities while retaining web URLs with labels. Seeded generators and focused canonicalization pass 3/3; restored fixed-oracle/native-handoff/canonical tests pass 3/3. Repeated behavioral revert proof: restored only src/privacy.ts from pre-round-2 head cf7b9f6, rebuilt, then node --test --test-name-pattern=\"seeded compositional|native CLI handoff|canonicalization handles\" test/privacy-admission.test.ts failed all 3 tests, exit 1. Native handoff returned success, fuzz missed non-home UNC case 2 and canonical root validation failed. Restored exact source and rebuilt; no coverage threshold changes."
  "2026-10-25T09:24:26.914Z",codex-agent,"Round-3 review resumes: preserve delimiters inside relative path tokens, validate real tracked fleet paths read-only without committing their list, retain absolute-path fuzz, and derive mutation refusal coverage from the registered command definitions. Audit start admission so refusals cannot leave ownership writes; record both behavioral revert proofs and exact-head CI gates."
  "2026-10-25T10:11:50.298Z",codex-agent,"Round-3 evidence: 17835 tracked relative paths across 35 local fleet checkouts pass 7 bare/prose/Markdown forms (124845 checks), with zero false refusals and no source writes. No path list is committed. The registry drives 13 mutating commands and 16 action variants; 374 scalar, domain and privacy input refusals preserve the complete tracker and emit no partial receipt. Cold private stored-footprint start now refuses before ownership, history, heartbeat or runtime changes via the public SDK mutation-guard lookup. SDK current-read side effects are tracked separately in pm-swarm-write-free-reads; no SDK-owned derived records are rolled back or removed."
  "2026-10-25T11:01:28.535Z",codex-agent,"Final round-3 path oracle: 17837 tracked relative paths across 35 checkouts, 160533 bare/prose/Markdown presentations, zero false refusals and zero source writes; inventory SHA-256 edd08af33aa0b0dd02ae2d6c9a995ab690e8943ac9e9666c6726b2960ff3068f. Path inventory stays uncommitted. This inventory has 0 parenthesis paths, 0 bracket paths and 1 slot paths; thirteen committed synthetic route/filename shapes cover the missing framework forms in nine presentations and both renderers."
  "2026-10-25T11:01:29.927Z",codex-agent,"Round-3 behavioral revert proofs: 18 isolated probes produced 19 expected regression failures. Each changed function body or guard was reverted independently to pre-round-3 behavior (tokenization reverted as its module); every probe exited 1, and exact source bytes were restored. Probes cover token edges, fresh receipt validation, shared/Git start and next, Git coordination liveness, generic admission, lease liveness/cleanup, resource metadata, progress actor and lookup, resource lookup, fence/sync/handoff preflight, unsafe foreign recovery and request publication. Exact targeted commands: fence-inspection: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=prepared tracker' test/privacy-refusals.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; foreign-recovery: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=reclaim skips unsafe foreign' test/privacy-guard.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; fresh-receipt: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=peer-changed receipt' test/privacy-routes.test.ts; 2 failed, exit 1; git-coordination: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=Git start admits' test/privacy-routes.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; git-next: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=Git next validates' test/privacy-routes.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; git-start: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=Git start admits' test/privacy-routes.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; handoff-preflight: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=prepared tracker' test/privacy-refusals.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; input-admission: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=registered mutators refuse every input' test/privacy-refusals.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; lease-admission: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=start rejects a private stored receipt' test/privacy-routes.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; progress-actor: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=prepared tracker' test/privacy-refusals.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; progress-inspection: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=prepared tracker' test/privacy-refusals.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; request-publication: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=request publication survives' test/privacy-lease.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; resource-inspection: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=prepared tracker' test/privacy-refusals.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; resource-record: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=prepared tracker' test/privacy-refusals.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; shared-next: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=shared next validates' test/privacy-routes.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; shared-start: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=start rejects a private stored receipt' test/privacy-routes.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; sync-inspection: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=prepared tracker' test/privacy-refusals.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1; tokenization: node --test --test-concurrency=1 '--test-name-pattern=path delimiters inside' test/privacy-routes.test.ts; 1 failed, exit 1. Post-restore Git admission tests pass 2/2; full focused restored checks follow through pinned pm test."
  "2026-10-25T11:01:31.451Z",codex-agent,"Round-3 registry metadata now covers 13 mutating commands and 19 variants, including all four progress stages and resource actions. Input matrix: 509 refusals. State/backend matrix: 35 refusals, prepared SDK cache, no tracker changes or partial receipts; together all 15 typed refusal categories. Original fixed-input matrix expands to 12660 byte-identical refusals across 52 encodings and 242 text positions, plus 1092 public SDK-entry refusals. Absolute fuzz seed 0x51a7c0de stays 5000 cases and now yields 95000 command refusals and 10000 renderer refusals. Allowed seed 0x6a09e667 yields 95000 admissions and 10000 renders over 2500 relative paths and 2500 URLs, zero false refusals. Existing progress/resource/scheduling targeted suites pass 26/26; lease fault/interleaving cases pass 6/6."
  "2026-10-25T11:05:27.678Z",codex-agent,"Restored round-3 focused suite passes 18/18 through pinned pm test --only-last --run --progress. A separate Git coordination admission fix prevents repository lock acquisition from refreshing principal liveness before validation; its isolated behavioral revert fails one Git byte-invariance regression, and restoring it passes both Git admission cases. Final local build, typecheck, lint, zero duplication and all authored-source docstrings pass; existing progress/resource/scheduling suites pass 26/26. Full release evidence will come from exact-head CI only."
  "2026-10-25T11:31:37.166Z",codex-agent,"CI run 40187437422 was cancelled after exposing two stale lease-test assumptions; it is not passing gate evidence. Renewal now measures liveness after its existing admitted write, and queued validation asserts no persistent principal heartbeat while always releasing its holder in finally. The complete fencing suite and provider-guard checks pass 13/13 locally. An isolated behavioral revert of withSwarmLease to b70ebfe makes node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern=\"queued operations defer\" test/fencing.test.ts fail 1/1 (exit 1), then restores source exactly. Cumulative round-3 proofs: 19 isolated probes, 20 expected test failures. Typecheck, lint and zero-duplication checks pass. Provider discovery also covers missing and empty capabilities without permitting a local shadow."
  "2026-10-25T11:32:09.914Z",codex-agent,"Pinned pm test --run --only-last --progress passed the fencing/provider group: 13 tests, zero failures. Final boundary review checked route token edges, SDK renderer fallback, prospective receipt revalidation and provider ownership. PR 24 is draft because native SDK settings registration and universal cold/provider-read byte invariance remain unmet integration criteria; these are documented rather than claimed complete. No merge or release."
